## Data & Asset Attributions

This project utilizes scientific data, orbital trajectories, and 3D models provided by external researchers and organizations. All rights to those datasets and assets remain with their respective creators:

### 1. Voyager Trajectory & Mission Dataset
- **Dataset Creator:** Toni Sagristà (tsagrista@ari.uni-heidelberg.de)
- **Project:** Gaia Sky (`spacecraft-voyagers` catalog)
- **Institution:** Astronomisches Rechen-Institut (ARI), Zentrum für Astronomie der Universität Heidelberg (ZAH)
- **Reference:** https://zah.uni-heidelberg.de/

### 2. Orbital Ephemeris Data
- **Source:** Celestia Motherlode (Addon 355)
- **Modifications:** Extended and interpolated for Gaia Sky by Toni Sagristà
- **Reference:** http://www.celestiamotherlode.net/addon/addon_355.html

### 3. Spacecraft 3D Model
- **Creator / Source:** NASA – Visualization Technology Applications and Development (VTAD)
- **Reference:** https://science.nasa.gov/resource/voyager-3d-model/
- **Copyright / Terms:** NASA media assets and 3D models are generally in the public domain and free for educational and informational use under NASA Media Usage Guidelines.

### 4. Mission Information & Media
- **Source:** NASA / Jet Propulsion Laboratory (JPL-Caltech)
- **Mission:** Voyager Interstellar Mission & Golden Record
- **Reference:** https://voyager.jpl.nasa.gov/
